&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Takealot.com is South Africa’s leading online retailer. We’re a young, dynamic, hyper-growth company looking for smart, enquiring minds to join us. Takealot.com offers a great work environment where boredom is rare, as long as you’re prepared for a challenge and want to build something great.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our Marketplace is recruiting a sales manager to lead our seller acquisition, onboarding and seller account Management teams. The&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Marketplace Sales Manager&lt;/strong&gt; reports to the &lt;strong&gt;Head of Marketplace&lt;/strong&gt; based in Cape Town.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
