&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement targeted training programs to upskill the sales team and align their skill set with dynamic business requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business Development and Marketplace Expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close high-impact deals with prominent retailers and brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and develop the emerging categories by signing key partnerships and coordinating launch with an internal team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Seller Retention and Growth Initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
