&lt;li&gt;Design and implement creative strategies to drive seller and brand growth and retention in-line with the business strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promotions, Merchandising and Revenue Optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct the Merchandising &amp;amp; Promotions team to optimize promotion planning and execution in line with seasonal campaigns and marketplace priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate across teams to enhance revenue optimization strategies through planned merchandising campaigns and tailored promotional efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholder Collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster productive partnerships with cross-functional teams such as Marketing, Operations, and Technical Development to deliver end-to-end improvements in seller and customer experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary liaison between sellers and internal stakeholders to ensure seamless marketplace operations.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
